# Interface definition for thorn TestMCNuX

IMPLEMENTS: TestMCNuX

# The Schwarzschild initial-data writers WRITE the ADMBaseX metric, curvature,
# and lapse grid functions, and the hydro-profile writers WRITE the HydroBaseX
# fluid grid functions; the CST accepts cross-thorn WRITES: clauses only
# through an INHERITS: (same rule as the READS: precedent in
# MCNuX/interface.ccl). This is write access to the published spacetime/fluid
# interfaces' declared initial-data schedule groups only.
INHERITS: ADMBaseX HydroBaseX

USES INCLUDE HEADER: loop_device.hxx
